-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are calculated and rounded to the nearest cent. A weekly plan costs 52/12 of its price per month. A yearly plan costs 1/12 of its price per month.
 
